            <ArticleTitle>[A method of intraluminal echoarteriography].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>233-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Interventional cardiology and new recanalisation methods have pressed the need for high frequency intra-arterial imaging to visualize obstructions. In a first in-vitro set-up it is shown that intra-arterial echo imaging is possible. Ideas to further integrate this with spark erosion are presented and serve for further study.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
